ment, not collaborative meaning-making.\",\r\n      \"Drill and practice is repetitive, not collaborative or meaning-focused.\"\r\n    ],\r\n    \"difficulty\": 1\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"id\": \"Q211\",\r\n    \"subarea\": \"Literature & Understanding\",\r\n    \"objective\": \"Language Acquisition, Transfer, and Cross-Curricular Language Development\",\r\n    \"stem\": \"Which best describes the link between language arts and other subjects?\",\r\n    \"options\": [\"They are unrelated\", \"Language arts reinforce cognitive skills across subjects\", \"Math and science develop separately\", \"Reading skills hinder science vocabulary\"],\r\n    \"correctIndex\": 1,\r\n    \"rationales\": [\r\n      \"Language and content are deeply interconnected.\",\r\n      \"Correct! Language arts skills (reading, writing, discussion) support learning across all disciplines.\",\r\n      \"All subjects require and develop language skills.\",\r\n      \"Reading skills support, not hinder, content vocabulary.\"\r\n    ],\r\n    \"difficulty\": 2\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"id\": \"Q212\",\r\n    \"subarea\": \"Literature & Understanding\",\r\n    \"objective\": \"Language Acquisition, Transfer, and Cross-Curricular Language Development\",\r\n    \"stem\": \"Teachers promoting 'language across the curriculum' encourage:\",\r\n    \"options\": [\"Grammar worksheets\", \"Writing and discussion in all content areas\", \"Oral reading only in English\", \"Reducing subject vocabulary\"],\r\n    \"correctIndex\": 1,\r\n    \"rationales\": [\r\n      \"Grammar worksheets are isolated skill practice, not curriculum integration.\",\r\n      \"Correct! Language across the curriculum integrates reading, writing, and speaking into all subjects.\",\r\n      \"Not limited to oral reading or English class.\",\r\n      \"Should expand, not reduce, vocabulary across subjects.\"\r\n    ],\r\n    \"difficulty\": 2\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"id\": \"Q213\",\r\n    \"subarea\": \"Literature & Understanding\",\r\n